              "settings": {
                "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ÚRSULA PRIVÉE · LA NOSTRA STORIA (versione solo testo, da affiancare al video\n  en la sección \"Multimedia con texto\"). Este comentario no pesa nada.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- liquid\n  assign ua_t1 = 'La nostra'\n  assign ua_t2 = 'storia'\n  assign ua_q = 'Il tuo stile parla prima di te.'\n  assign ua_txt = ua_t1 | append: ua_t2 | append: ua_q\n-%}\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;1,300;1,400&text={{ ua_txt | url_encode }}&display=swap\" media=\"print\" onload=\"this.media='all'\">\n<div class=\"uat\"><p class=\"uat-e\">Chi siamo</p><h2>{{ ua_t1 }} <em>{{ ua_t2 }}</em></h2><p>Úrsula Privée è nata da un'idea semplice: vestirsi bene non dovrebbe dipendere dall'occasione, ma da come vuoi sentirti.</p><p>Scegliamo ogni capo uno a uno, pensando a donne vere: a come cade il tessuto, a se valorizza davvero e a se ti accompagnerà allo stesso modo a un pranzo infrasettimanale come a un matrimonio d'estate.</p><p class=\"uat-q\">{{ ua_q }}</p><a class=\"uat-c\" href=\"{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}\">Scopri la collezione<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 4.5h22M18.5 1l3.5 3.5L18.5 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/></svg></a></div>\n<style>.uat{--k:#1c1a17;--m:#6f655c;--f:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;--e:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);max-width:440px;color:var(--k);text-align:left}.uat-e{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--m)}.uat-e:before{content:'';width:28px;height:1px;background:currentColor}.uat h2{margin:0 0 18px;font:300 clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.6rem)/1 var(--f);color:var(--k);word-break:normal;overflow-wrap:normal}.uat p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a433d}.uat .uat-q{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:20px 0 0;font:italic 400 1.35rem/1.2 var(--f);color:var(--k)}.uat-q:before{content:'';flex:none;width:28px;height:1px;background:currentColor}.uat-c{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:24px;padding-bottom:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--k);text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(currentColor,currentColor) 0 100%/28px 1px no-repeat;transition:background-size .9s var(--e)}.uat-c svg{width:24px;height:9px;transition:transform .9s var(--e)}.uat-c:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--k);outline-offset:4px}@media(hover:hover){.uat-c:hover{background-size:100% 1px}.uat-c:hover svg{transform:translateX(5px)}}</style>"
